      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Wang et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Nassella hyalina (cane needle grass) is on the Alert List for Environmental Weeds in Australia. We present here the first complete chloroplast sequence of N. hyalina reconstructed from Illumina whole-genome sequencing. The complete chloroplast sequence is 137,606 bp in size and has a gene content and structure similar to those of other published chloroplast genomes of Stipeae."
      },
